			"hadithnumber": 4788,
			"arabicnumber": 4788,
			"text": "Narrated Aisha, Ummul Mu'minin: When the Prophet (ﷺ) was informed of anything of a certain man, he would not say: What is the matter with so and so that he says? But he would say: What is the matter with the people that they say such and such?",
